  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Central Continent elders list Blood Sea’s nine true inheritances and name the ancient desolate beast violent blood dragon bat among them, saying that inheritance is with Song Zi Xing.",
      "chapters": [
        407
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "loc_blood_sea",
        "char_song_zi_xing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recalls that Song Zi Xing held one part of the blood sea inheritance, the ancient desolate beast violent blood dragon bat, and that this dragon bat is not a Gu worm and can be captured and taken away. He plans that with it he would gain an endless number of blood bats, since manipulating blood bats was one of his greatest skills in his previous life.",
      "chapters": [
        408
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "not-a-gu-worm",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Song Zi Xing’s violent blood dragon bat is an ancient desolate beast and one of the nine true inheritances of Ancestor Blood Sea.",
      "chapters": [
        409
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ancient-desolate-beast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blood_sea_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Observers call Song Zi Xing the Blood Dragon and say his violent blood dragon bat has rank seven battle strength. Heavenly Lotus Sect Gu Immortals identify that bat when it crashes into Illusion Garden and self-detonates, and they treat an ancient desolate beast’s self-detonation as equivalent to rank seven Gu Immortal battle strength. Song Zi Xing then notes that he lost his violent blood dragon bat.",
      "chapters": [
        849
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-strength",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "house_illusion_garden"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After that battle Song Zi Xing lost an ancient desolate beast violent blood dragon bat, and when he reappeared he had nurtured three violent blood dragon bats.",
      "chapters": [
        850
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "replacement-bats",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s recount of Blood Sea Ancestor’s nine Gu Immortal level true inheritances includes the method to raise and enslave the ancient desolate beast violent blood dragon bat, and says Shadow Sect’s Song Zi Xing obtained that true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        2246
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
